```bash
$ cargo test
   Compiling rlibc-x2 v0.1.0
   Compiling rlibc-x2-tests v0.1.0
    ...
     Running unittests (rlibc-x2)
     Running tests/environ.rs (rlibc-x2)
     Running unittests (rlibc-x2-tests)  # ← builds & runs integration binaries

test environ::test_environ_not_null ... ok
test environ::integration_test ... ok    # ← spawns test-environ binary
...

test result: ok. X passed; 0 failed
```

The `rlibc-x2-tests` crate would have tests like:

```rust
